# Magicbricks

> Magicbricks is India's leading online real estate platform, founded in 2006 and operated by Magicbricks Realty Services Limited (a Times Internet / Times Group company). Headquartered in Noida, India, Magicbricks enables property buyers, sellers, renters, and investors to discover, evaluate, and transact on residential and commercial real estate across 300+ Indian cities. The platform also offers home loans, home interior design services, property valuation tools, market intelligence, and expert real estate advice.

