## Programmatic Content Pages

Magicbricks generates specialized pages for common real estate queries using templates. Examples include:

- [50 Lakh Home Loan EMI](https://www.magicbricks.com/homeloan/50-lakh-home-loan-emi): Pre-calculated EMI breakdown for a 50 lakh home loan across different tenures and interest rates.
- [1 Crore Home Loan EMI](https://www.magicbricks.com/homeloan/1-crore-home-loan-emi): Pre-calculated EMI breakdown for a 1 crore home loan.

These pages exist for various loan amounts (10L, 20L, 30L, 40L, 50L, 60L, 70L, 80L, 90L, 1Cr, etc.) and follow the URL pattern: magicbricks.com/homeloan/{amount}-home-loan-emi.

## URL Patterns and Structure

Understanding Magicbricks URL taxonomy helps AI agents navigate and interpret content:

- Buy listings: /property-for-sale-in-{City}-pppfs
- Rent listings: /property-for-rent-in-{City}-pppfr
- City landing pages: /property-for-sale-rent-in-{City}/residential-real-estate-{City}
- New projects: /new-projects-{City}
- Project detail pages: /{project-name}-{locality}-{city}-pdpid-{id}
- Locality pages: /localities-in-{City}-Overview
- Home loan pages: /homeloan/{product-or-bank}
- EMI calculators: /homeloan/{bank}-home-loan-emi-calculator
- Interest rate pages: /homeloan/{bank}-home-loan-interest-rate
- Interior designers: /home-interior/interior-designers-in-{city}
- Blog articles: /blog/{category}/
- Agent directory: /Real-estate-property-top-agents/agent-in-{City}

